# Input
```css
/* should generate diagnostics */
$color: red;
unknown {
  color: $color;
}
.card { from { color: red; } }
@mixin nested-in-rule { .card { from { color: red; } } }
@mixin combined { div from {} from > a {} from.active {} & from {} }
@mixin other-unknown { unknown {} }
@include content-block { .card { to {} } }
@mixin in-media { @media print { from {} } }
@mixin in-supports { @supports (opacity: 0) { to {} } }
@mixin namespaced { svg|from {} |to {} }

```

